夢の色を描いて
Painting the colors of our dreams.

570
00:52:43,424 --> 00:52:47,194
曇りがちな気分もちょっと目線を変えたなら
Even a gloomy mood brightens if you change your perspective,

571
00:52:47,464 --> 00:52:49,284
